Bitcoin-rs source and upstream notice bundle

This package is part of https://github.com/klebs6/bitcoin-rs.
LICENSE preserves the repository's existing MIT notice verbatim, including
its Bitcoin developer copyright notices.

The modular LevelDB port and its support closure also have upstream origins:

- LevelDB: https://github.com/google/leveldb
  License text: LICENSE.leveldb
  Source: https://github.com/google/leveldb/blob/main/LICENSE
  Copyright (c) 2011 The LevelDB Authors. All rights reserved.
- CRC32C: https://github.com/google/crc32c
  License text: LICENSE.crc32c
  Source: https://github.com/google/crc32c/blob/main/LICENSE
  Copyright 2017, The CRC32C Authors.

The two upstream license texts were checked against those primary sources
on 2026-11-15; their line wrapping/blank lines are normalized. These files
retain notices and conditions for the port and its dependency closure.
Their inclusion does not attribute every file to every listed holder,
replace file-specific notices, grant new rights, or rewrite Git authorship.

Source-origin comments identify translated C++ paths where available.
External Cargo dependencies retain their own licenses and notices; this
bundle is not a complete license inventory of all external dependencies.
Package SPDX declarations and source-specific attribution remain a final
release-review obligation. This preparation preserves the existing declared
MIT expressions instead of silently changing the project's licensing.
